# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Whitelist .gitignore.
#
# This working directory also holds the *design tooling* for the omakase-pixel
# build — the omarchy.org hero `pixel-field.js` web module plus the theme/palette
# build scripts (`make_palette.py`, `build_theme.py`, `index.html`, `src/`, `out/`,
# `README.web-module.md`, ...). Only the installable SUPER+SPACE menu effect and
# the omakase-pixel palette theme are published, so everything is ignored by
# default and the bundle is explicitly re-included below.
#
# GITIGNORE TRAP: the re-include patterns for the two bundle *directories*
# must be written WITHOUT a trailing slash. `/*` excludes the directory
# entries themselves, and git refuses to descend into an excluded directory to
# re-include its children — so `!/omakase-pixel/` (with the slash) is dead.
# `!/omakase-pixel` re-includes the directory and lets git walk into it.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Ignore everything at the repo root by default.
/*

# --- the publish list: root files -----------------------------------
!/.gitignore
!/install.sh
!/README.md
!/LICENSE

# The palette theme (re-include the dir so its whole subtree is walked).
!/omakase-pixel

# The SUPER+SPACE menu plugin (same: re-include the dir, walk the subtree).
!/omakase-pixel.menu

# --- keep the tree clean regardless --------------------------------
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
